 "business": {
  "text": "We are an organized, fully integrated manufacturer of gold and diamond jewellery [Source: CareEdge Report]. As a fully integrated manufacturer, we are engaged in all aspects of manufacturing value chain, from encompassing product design, production, quality control and sale of such jewellery to various retailers. As on July 31, 2026, we had an extensive and diversified collection, comprising over 500,000 designs [Source: CareEdge Report]. We offer a comprehensive product portfolio of plain gold, studded gold and diamond jewellery which comprises necklaces, bangles, rings, earrings, pendants, mangalsutra, bracelets and chains.",
